      "snippet": "Assistant: 看完日志了，问题很清楚： ## 🔍 原因分析 **核心问题：MiniMax API 超时导致连锁阻塞** 日志里反复出现： ``` Profile minimax:cn timed out. Trying next account... [llm-idle-timeout] minimax/MiniMax-M2.7 produced no reply before the idle watchdog embedded run failover decision ... failoverReason=timeout ``` ###",
